  "schema:version": "1",
  "schema:description": "This dataset contains a spreadsheet with the original data that was collected / analysed in relation to the paper &quot;Elucidation of the mechanisms of action of Bacteriophage K / nano-emulsion formulations against S. aureus via measurement of particle size and zeta potential&quot;\n\nMethods: Methodology is clearly explained in the paper to which this data set is related.\n\nMethods: Standard techniques as per the paper related to this dataset.\n\nTechnical information: As per the paper related to this dataset.\n\nMethods: Further relevant documentation may be found in the following resources. Esteban, P. P., Jenkins, A. T. A., and Arnot, T. C., 2016. Elucidation of the mechanisms of action of Bacteriophage K/nano-emulsion formulations against S. aureus via measurement of particle size and zeta potential. Colloids and Surfaces B: Biointerfaces, 139, 87-94. Available from: https://doi.org/10.1016/j.colsurfb.2015.11.030.",
